### ========== Health Check ==========

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/

### Registered user
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Obtain user information
GET http://localhost:8000/user/1

### Modify user information (change password)
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": null,
  "password": "newpassword"
}

### Obtain a non-existent user (expected to return an error)
GET http://localhost:8000/user/9999

### Update the user name
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new1"
}

###

### Update the username and email address simultaneously
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new",
  "email": "New1@163.com"
}

###

### Update password
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "newpassword123"
}

###

### Update to an existing email address (expected to return an error
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "existing@example.com"
}


### ========== Destination(Global Purpose Basement)==========

### Create a destination
POST http://localhost:8000/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tokyo",
  "description": "Japan capital, vibrant city",
  "rating": 5
}

### Get all destinations
GET http://localhost:8000/destinations

### Get a single destination
GET http://localhost:8000/destinations/1

### Get a destination that does not exist (expected to return an error)
GET http://localhost:8000/destinations/9999

### 删除目的地
DELETE http://localhost:8000/destinations/4



### ========== Trip ==========

### Create a itinerary
POST http://localhost:8000/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "title": "Japan Trip 2025",
  "date_range": "2025-03-01 ~ 2025-03-10",
  "destinations_count": 0,
  "budget": 5000,
  "rating": 5,
  "status": "draft"
}

### Get the user itinerary list (the latest 2 items)
GET http://localhost:8000/trips?user_id=1

### Get all the user's recent trips
GET http://localhost:8000/trips/recent?user_id=1

### Get a single trip
GET http://localhost:8000/trips/1

### Update itinerary
PUT http://localhost:8000/trips/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Japan Trip 2025 Updated",
  "status": "completed",
  "budget": 6000
}

### Get a non-existent process (expected to return an error)
GET http://localhost:8000/trips/9999

### Delete the itinerary
DELETE http://localhost:8000/trips/3


### ========== TripDestination（Destinations within the itinerary）==========

### Add the first destination to the itinerary (Day 1)
POST http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shinjuku",
  "description": "Famous shopping and entertainment district",
  "day_number": 1,
  "budget": 300,
  "actual_cost": 0
}

### Add a second destination to the itinerary (Day 2)）
POST http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shibuya",
  "description": "Iconic crossing and youth culture hub",
  "day_number": 2,
  "budget": 200,
  "actual_cost": 0
}

### Add a third destination to the itinerary (minimum request, using default values)
POST http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asakusa"
}

### Add a destination to a non-existent itinerary (expected 404)
POST http://localhost:8000/trips/9999/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Destination"
}

### Get all destinations of the itinerary (sorted by days)
GET http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations

### Update the destination of the itinerary
PUT http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shinjuku (Updated)",
  "description": "Also great for nightlife",
  "day_number": 1,
  "budget": 350,
  "actual_cost": 320
}

### Only update the actual cost (partially updated)
PUT http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actual_cost": 180
}

### Update non-existent destinations (expected 404)
PUT http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost"
}

### Delete the itinerary destination
DELETE http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/3

### Delete non-existent destinations (expected 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/9999


### ========== Statistics ==========

### Obtain user statistics
GET http://localhost:8000/stats?user_id=1